    <Description>
      <One_Line_Description_Summary/>
      <Description>Provides deterministic interprocess communication (Cyclic InterProcess Communication) that is lockless for low latency and jitter.   

This library provides wrappers around the NI dll for CIPC (circular interprocess communication) library.</Description>
      <Copyright/>
      <Packager>DOME Automation</Packager>
      <URL/>
      <Release_Notes>Backpressure code created.  Partial array writer added.</Release_Notes>
    </Description>
